## 6. Service Accounts & Bound Projected Tokens

```
                        BOUND PROJECTED SERVICEACCOUNT TOKENS
  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │ • Short-Lived: 1-hour default TTL with automated Kubelet rotation.     │
  │ • Audience-Bound: Valid ONLY for specified audience (`https://api...`) │
  │ • Lifecycle-Bound: Instantly invalidated when the Pod is terminated.   │
  │ • Stored in-memory via `tmpfs` volume, never persisted to node disk.   │
  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

```yaml
# Disable token automount if Pod does not query the K8s API
apiVersion: v1
kind: Pod
metadata:
  name: batch-worker
spec:
  automountServiceAccountToken: false
```

---

## 7. Secrets Management, KMS Plugins & Envelope Encryption at Rest

```
                                  [ Plaintext Secret ]
                                           │
                                           ▼
[ kube-apiserver ] ───> [ KMS Plugin (AWS KMS / Vault / Azure Key Vault) ]
                                           │ (Envelope Encryption: Encrypted with DEK/KEK)
                                           ▼
                                  [ Encrypted in etcd ]
```

### Production Secret Management Principles
1. **Never store plaintext secrets in Git:** Use External Secrets Operator (ESO) or Sealed Secrets.
2. **KMS Envelope Encryption:** Encrypt the Data Encryption Key (DEK) with a Key Encryption Key (KEK) managed in cloud KMS.
3. **Automated Secret Rotation:** Enforce dynamic credential lifetimes via HashiCorp Vault.

---

## 8. Control Plane & Worker Node Hardening Flags

```
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                        CONTROL PLANE & NODE HARDENING FLAGS                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| kube-apiserver:                                                                   |
|   --anonymous-auth=false                                                          |
|   --authorization-mode=Node,RBAC                                                  |
|   --enable-admission-plugins=NodeRestriction,PodSecurity                          |
|   --audit-log-path=/var/log/kubernetes/audit.log                                  |
|   --encryption-provider-config=/etc/kubernetes/encryption.yaml                    |
|                                                                                   |
| kubelet:                                                                          |
|   --anonymous-auth=false                                                          |
|   --authorization-mode=Webhook                                                    |
|   --read-only-port=0                                                              |
|   --protect-kernel-defaults=true                                                  |
|                                                                                   |
| etcd:                                                                             |
|   --client-cert-auth=true                                                         |
|   --peer-client-cert-auth=true                                                    |
|   --cert-file=/etc/kubernetes/pki/etcd/server.crt                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

